{"sha": "18a827a63ba549473fa9572d704945f335939815f26778caa3d8da66f0e0a832", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % layer A", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,4} \\foreach \\j in {0,...,3} {", "    \\pgfmathsetmacro\\x{\\i+0.5*\\j}", "    \\pgfmathsetmacro\\y{0.866*\\j}", "    \\draw[black!60, fill=omDef!25] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.5);", "  }", "  % layer B, in the hollows pointing up", "  \\foreach \\i/\\j in {1/0, 2/0, 3/0, 1/1, 2/1, 3/1, 1/2, 2/2} {", "    \\pgfmathsetmacro\\x{\\i+0.5*\\j}", "    \\pgfmathsetmacro\\y{0.866*\\j+0.577}", "    \\draw[omThm!80!black, fill=omThm!25, fill opacity=0.75] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.5);", "  }", "  % C positions", "  \\foreach \\i/\\j in {1/0, 2/0, 3/0, 1/1, 2/1, 3/1} {", "    \\pgfmathsetmacro\\x{\\i+0.5+0.5*\\j}", "    \\pgfmathsetmacro\\y{0.866*\\j+0.289}", "    \\fill[omMeth] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.11);", "  }", "  \\node[anchor=west, align=left] at (6.6,1.6) {A：第一层（蓝色）\\\\B：第二层，位于\\\\\\phantom{B：}A 的空穴中（红色）\\\\C：其他空穴\\\\\\phantom{C：}（绿点）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 从上方看到的两层密堆积层，第三层可以放在", "标记为 C 的空穴上方（堆叠方式 $ABC$，面心立方），或放在", "A 层原子的上方（堆叠方式 $AB$，六方密堆积）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[面心立方]\\label{prop:b1:crystals-metals:fcc}", "在面心立方结构中，原子占据棱长为 $a$ 的立方体的八个角顶", "和六个面心。于是 $Z = 4$，配位数为", "12，原子沿面对角线相接触，$a\\sqrt2 = 4R$，且", "堆积率为", "\\[", "  C = \\frac{\\pi}{3\\sqrt2} \\approx 0.74 .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$Z = 8 \\times \\frac18 + 6 \\times \\frac12 = 4$。面心原子与其所在面的四个角顶原子相接触，", "以及与共用该面的两个晶胞中各四个面心原子相接触，", "共 $4 + 4 + 4 = 12$ 个近邻，距离为 $a\\sqrt2/2$。在", "长为 $a\\sqrt2$ 的面对角线上，依次排列一个角顶原子、一个面心原子", "和一个角顶原子相互接触，故 $a\\sqrt2 = 4R$。于是", "$C = 4 \\cdot \\frac43\\pi R^3/a^3 = \\frac{16}{3}\\pi R^3/(2\\sqrt2 R)^3 \\cdot", "\\frac{1}{1} = \\frac{16\\pi}{3 \\times 16\\sqrt2} = \\frac{\\pi}{3\\sqrt2}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\tdplotsetmaincoords{60}{100}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[tdplot_main_coords, font=\\small]", "  \\pic {omcubeo={3}};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (0,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (0,3,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm, ball color=omDef!55] at (0,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (0,0,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm, ball color=omDef!55] at (1.5,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (0,3,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm, ball color=omDef!55] at (1.5,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm, ball color=omDef!55] at (1.5,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (3,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm, ball color=omDef!55] at (1.5,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (3,3,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm, ball color=omDef!55] at (3,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (3,0,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (3,3,3) {};", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (3,0,0) -- (3,3,3);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\hspace{1.2cm}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[tdplot_main_coords, font=\\small]", "  \\pic {omcubeo={3}};", "  \\node[cellA=7mm] at (0,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=7mm] at (0,3,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=7mm] at (0,0,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=7mm] at (0,3,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=7mm, ball color=omDef!55] at (1.5,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[cellA=7mm] at (3,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=7mm] at (3,3,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=7mm] at (3,0,3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=7mm] at (3,3,3) {};", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (3,0,0) -- (0,3,3);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左：面心立方晶胞（角顶原子为灰色，面心", "原子为蓝色）。原子沿面对角线接触（红线，", "$a\\sqrt2 = 4R$）。右：体心立方晶胞；原子沿", "体对角线接触（红线，$a\\sqrt3 = 4R$）。", "原子的绘制直径小于接触尺寸，以便观察。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[六方密堆积]\\label{prop:b1:crystals-metals:hcp}", "在六方密堆积结构中，常规六角柱的底边长为 $a$，", "高为 $c$，含 6 个原子；配位数为 12；对于", "相切的球体，$a = 2R$，$c/a = \\sqrt{8/3} \\approx 1.633$，且", "堆积率与面心立方相同，为 $\\pi/(3\\sqrt2) \\approx 0.74$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "该棱柱含 12 个角顶原子，各被 6 个棱柱共用，2 个面心原子，", "各被 2 个棱柱共用，内部另有 3 个原子：$12/6 + 2/2 + 3 = 6$。每个原子", "与本层六个近邻及相邻每层各三个近邻相接触，共 12 个近邻。", "B 层的一个原子落在 A 层三个相互接触的原子上，形成棱长为 $2R$ 的正四面体，", "其高为 $2R\\sqrt{2/3}$；相隔两层时，", "$c = 4R\\sqrt{2/3}$，故 $c/a = 2\\sqrt{2/3} = \\sqrt{8/3}$。棱柱", "体积为 $\\frac{3\\sqrt3}{2}a^2 c = \\frac{3\\sqrt3}{2}(2R)^2 \\cdot", "4R\\sqrt{2/3} = 24\\sqrt2\\,R^3$，且 $C = 6 \\cdot \\frac43\\pi R^3/(24\\sqrt2", "R^3) = \\pi/(3\\sqrt2)$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\tdplotsetmaincoords{70}{113}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[tdplot_main_coords, font=\\small, scale=1.25]", "  \\pic[transform shape] {omhexprismo={1.6}{2.6}};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (-1.6,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (-0.8,-1.386,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (-1.6,0,2.6) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (-0.8,-1.386,2.6) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (-0.8,1.386,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm, ball color=omThm!60] at (-0.8,0.462,1.3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (0,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm, ball color=omThm!60] at (0,-0.924,1.3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (0.8,-1.386,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (-0.8,1.386,2.6) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (0,0,2.6) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (0.8,-1.386,2.6) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (0.8,1.386,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm, ball color=omThm!60] at (0.8,0.462,1.3) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (1.6,0,0) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (0.8,1.386,2.6) {};", "  \\node[cellA=6mm] at (1.6,0,2.6) {};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}